sequenceDiagram
  participant H as Host app
  participant S as Rooms server (Cloudflare Worker)
  participant V as Viewer app
  H->>S: connect over WebSocket (TLS)
  S-->>H: one-time challenge
  H->>S: challenge signed with the device key
  H->>S: create a room, ask for an invite
  S-->>H: invite (stored only as a hash, expiry, use limit)
  H-->>V: invite sent through any chat
  V->>S: signed challenge and the invite
  S-->>V: room members, who is live
  S-->>H: viewer joined
